# Digio - QR code data response (A18), the FIRST of two answers.
# Tags from the §"Response QR Code Data" block. The payload is on tag QR -
#   0x51 0x52 - with a BER long-form length, which is exactly the shape a
#   strict BER reader mis-reads (0x51 as a tag, 0x52 as a length).
# The payload here is a SIMULATED string, not an EMVCo code: the simulator
#   is not a PromptPay issuer and will not pretend to mint a payable one.
#   The real payload arrives on this same tag.
# Source: Digio "A920 Link-PoS-Spec" v2.21 (20 Oct 2025), section numbers as
#   printed there.
# Framing per §4: [3E 55][BER length][content][XOR CRC over header..content].
# THE CRC IS GENERATED, NEVER COPIED: seven of the ten complete frames the
#   document prints carry a CRC its own §4 rule does not produce.
# Recorded from the wire between src/terminal/digio.ts and simulator-digio.ts.


